  --      rc.lua that also handles the quake backtick workaround. The
  --      combined grabber always runs, returns false (pass-through) for
  --      all events except backtick+Mod4, and observes Super_L
  --      press/release and other key presses to detect a solo tap.
  --      Chorded keys (Super+Z etc.) pass through to the normal
  --      keybinding system because the grabber returns false for them.
